# JIRA_ROLES — name-to-role roster for the role-aware scorecards (WP5).
#
# Format mirrors JIRA_TEAM_PEOPLE: role=Name,Name;role=Name,...
# Names must match Jira assignee display names exactly (they are matched
# case-sensitively, like the team roster). A person listed nowhere renders
# under "role unknown" and is not scored — never scored wrongly by default.
#
# Valid roles: backend, frontend, mobile, mlops-ai, recommendation,
#   ai-recommendation, qa-automated, qa-manual, pm, bizdev
#
# Every assignee seen in the live data on 2026-08-16 is listed below under
# "unsorted" — move each name into its role. Delete anyone no longer active.
#
# JIRA_ROLES="backend=;frontend=;mobile=;mlops-ai=;recommendation=;ai-recommendation=;qa-automated=;qa-manual=Dina QA;pm=;bizdev="
#
# unsorted (from assignee data, most active first):
